---
/**
 * "notas de cinta" teaser block — layout/structure ported from
 * reference/home-mockup-reference.html. The h3/body copy was
 * replaced with Esteban's approved final text in Mission 09
 * (missions/MISSION_09_notas-de-cinta-bio.md) — the eyebrow, the
 * placeholder photo block, and the "leer notas" button/link are
 * untouched since Mission 01/02.
 */
---

<section class="block">
  <div class="notas-teaser">
    <div class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">notas de cinta</p>
      <h3>amigos haciendo arte desde nuestra casa</h3>
      <p>
        Caracterizados por amistades largas y pretensiones cortas, conocé
        la historia de Audiocassettes.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/notas-de-cinta">leer notas</a>
    </div>
    <div class="placeholder-block photo-block">
      [ espacio para foto de banda ]
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .block {
    max-width: 68.75rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1rem;
  }

  .notas-teaser {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .notas-teaser {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .card {
    background: rgba(89, 51, 44, 0.06);
    border: 2px solid var(--brown-tape);
    padding: 1.75rem;
  }

  .card .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--view-master);
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }

  .card h3 {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .card p:not(.eyebrow) {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    opacity: 0.85;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .card .btn-solid {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-transform: lowercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.8125rem 1.625rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--brown-tape);
    color: var(--vintage-sky);
    border: 2px solid var(--brown-tape);
  }

  .card .btn-solid:hover {
    background: var(--view-master);
    border-color: var(--view-master);
  }

  .photo-block {
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
</style>
